# kages-ignore-start v1
# Managed by `kages gitignore`. Shared artifacts stay tracked:
#   config.json, brief.md, critique/*.md
**/.kages/store.json
**/.kages/config.local.json
**/.kages/screenshots/
**/.kages/cache/
**/.kages/review/
**/.kages/report/
**/.kages/advice.log.ndjson*
**/.kages/hook.cache.json
**/.kages/hook.pending.json
**/.kages/install.json
# kages-ignore-end
